# Learn › Lesson 1 (Deploy the fleet): the patrol fleet placed by hand with the
# cursor keys and Enter (bow at the cursor, the next ship selected after each),
# confirmed from the tray; the first shot by the cursor (arm, then fire); then
# Escape opens the pause card and Leave match returns to the title.
until 600 FLEET SIGNALS
frames 30
click =Learn
until 120 Lesson 1
frames 10
click =Start #1
until 300 Deploy your fleet
frames 60
save deploy-start
key ArrowRight 1
frames 5
key Enter 1
frames 10
key ArrowDown 1
frames 3
key ArrowDown 1
frames 5
key Enter 1
frames 10
key ArrowDown 1
frames 3
key ArrowDown 1
frames 5
key Enter 1
frames 30
save deploy-placed
click =Confirm deployment
until 120 Objective complete
until 600 Your turn
frames 70
key ArrowRight 1
frames 5
key Enter 1
frames 10
save deploy-armed
key Enter 1
frames 10
until 900 Your turn
frames 70
key Escape 1
until 60 Paused
frames 10
save deploy-pause
click =Leave match
until 300 FLEET SIGNALS
